    "font size" : 9.7,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Techniques of vegetation sampling and analysis for the pre-gypsum amendment years of 1981 through 1986 were described in preceeding reports (Smith et al 1985, 1986; Schuman et al 1989; Belden et al 1990). Methods and results of postgypsum amendment soil sampling were described by Meining (1991 ), and will not be included in this paper."
